  "body": "### Summary\nAs a user, I want the long-press menu on an MP row and on a search result to offer legacy's page shortcuts, so that every list row behaves alike.\n\n### Scope\n- **MP rows**:\n  - Legacy (`TopicQuickActionPolicy.privateMessages`, `Common.swift:2622-2629`, `MPListView.swift:845` @ 87fe0d1c) offers Première page, Dernière page, Page numéro… and Copier le lien, without Dernière réponse.\n  - #676 covers « Marquer non lu » / « Supprimer »; these entries go alongside them.\n  - SwiftHFR has no menu (`MessageListView.swift:28-39`).\n- **Search results**:\n  - Legacy (`.globalSearch`, `Common.swift:2614-2621`, `:3557-3600`, `ForumSearchView.swift:346-360`) offers « Dernière correspondance », Première page, Dernière page, Dernière réponse, Page numéro… and Copier le lien.\n  - SwiftHFR has none (`SearchResultRow`, `ForumSearchView.swift:163-183`).\n- Reuse `TopicQuickActions` and the topic list's « Page numéro » prompt.\n\n### Acceptance criteria\n- [ ] Entries appear only when they can run (HIG, #1162), in legacy order.\n- [ ] Tests on the quick-action targets.\n- [ ] An MP or search link is never guessed: if it is not in a fixture, open a capture issue.\n\nFrom the consistency matrix of #693 (PR #1306, w693). Related: #676.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_\n",
